  "content": {
    "id": "p7-q14-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "14",
    "prompt": "Solve each of the following equations for $x$ by using cross multiplication:",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p7-q14-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x}{a}=\\dfrac{b}{c}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{ab}{c}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}cx&=ab\\\\x&=\\frac{ab}{c}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q14-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{a}{x+b}=\\dfrac{c}{d}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{ad-bc}{c}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}ad&=c(x+b)\\\\ad&=cx+bc\\\\cx&=ad-bc\\\\x&=\\frac{ad-bc}{c}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q14-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x+a}{b}=\\dfrac{x+c}{d}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{bc-ad}{d-b}$\n\nCross multiply, collect the $x$ terms and factorise.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}d(x+a)&=b(x+c)\\\\dx+ad&=bx+bc\\\\dx-bx&=bc-ad\\\\(d-b)x&=bc-ad\\\\x&=\\frac{bc-ad}{d-b}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q14-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x-a}{b}=\\dfrac{x+b}{a}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{a^2+b^2}{a-b}$\n\nCross multiply, collect the $x$ terms and factorise.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}a(x-a)&=b(x+b)\\\\ax-a^2&=bx+b^2\\\\ax-bx&=a^2+b^2\\\\(a-b)x&=a^2+b^2\\\\x&=\\frac{a^2+b^2}{a-b}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q14-e",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "e",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x-a}{ax+1}=b$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{a+b}{1-ab}$\n\nMultiply by the denominator, collect the $x$ terms and factorise.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}x-a&=b(ax+1)\\\\x-a&=abx+b\\\\x-abx&=a+b\\\\(1-ab)x&=a+b\\\\x&=\\frac{a+b}{1-ab}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      },
      {
        "id": "p7-q14-f",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "f",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x+a}{a-x}=\\dfrac{b}{c}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=\\dfrac{a(b-c)}{b+c}$\n\nCross multiply, collect the $x$ terms and factorise.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}c(x+a)&=b(a-x)\\\\cx+ac&=ab-bx\\\\cx+bx&=ab-ac\\\\(b+c)x&=a(b-c)\\\\x&=\\frac{a(b-c)}{b+c}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 44
      }
    ]
  },
